<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 69.8358 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 69.8358 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 69.8358 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.9538 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 10		  Oct 9</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.8358		 69.9538</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  0.380		   1.620</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.8980		 46.0000</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.075		   0.010</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
